{
  "Name": "WatchGuard XTM Firebox Unauthenticated Remote Command Execution",
  "Description": "This module exploits a buffer overflow at the administration interface (8080 or 4117) of WatchGuard Firebox and XTM appliances which is built from a cherrypy python backend sending XML-RPC requests to a C binary called wgagent using pre-authentication endpoint /agent/login. This vulnerability impacts Fireware OS before 12.7.2_U2, 12.x before 12.1.3_U8, and 12.2.x through 12.5.x before 12.5.9_U2. Successful exploitation results in remote code execution as user nobody.",
